\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces The gate: pp within topic and year (topic edges and keywords: against the same year's other papers). Rows differ in population and unit: compare replication status, not size. Held-out tests are one-sided and confirm direction, not size. $^a$Registered; predicted a penalty; MDE80 4.8. $^b$Explored against acceptance before registration. Titles: the discovery estimate is not a test; held-out MDE80 3.2. Keywords: the discovery estimate is a declared post hoc test on a dimension already seen. $^c$Holm across the six secondary held-out tests: topic edge 0.019, same author 0.026, insider 0.052, Emerging keywords 0.063.}}{15}{table.caption.46}\protected@file@percent }
